{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-01_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-01","title":"坍塌","storyCode":"0-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b506f8fa5c310eee9e8b71ef9faa3dbc6d756fa8d472395510e975ccc77edde0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"切尔诺伯格中一片混乱，整合运动四处烧杀掠夺，秩序已然崩溃。\n明知应该撤退，但为了救人，罗德岛还是毅然出手。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，究竟怎么了？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_2_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这边的屋子，也都给我搜干净！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放开他......不！你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反抗？太迟了！可恨的切尔诺伯格人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！不要管我......孩子就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......妈妈......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别管平民！先把阵线守住！这些面具混蛋，人实在是太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别让军警闲着！继续打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"增援怎么还没到！我们要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上啊，上啊！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......？！为什么，为什么整合运动会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"遮遮掩掩这么多年，还是露出本性了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"感，感染者......在袭击乌萨斯人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"为，为什么！感染者这样去骚扰乌萨斯政府的话，会死无葬身之地的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们的攻势相当猛烈。这绝对是有预谋的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我们救出博士的位置，相当机密......就连那里都被他们渗入了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可能切尔诺伯格各处，都已经遭到了整合运动的袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这，怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有逃脱的切尔诺伯格人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在搜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个也别漏掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格的冷血动物......刻在我父辈身上的痛苦，这次，就让我全都还给你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（他，他们，发......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（安静！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呜......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在这儿！找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呜哇哇哇！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！不，别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在巷子里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在那里，就有用吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对，对不起！对不起啊！！至少，至少饶了我的儿子！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们应该，立刻突袭整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道有风险，杜宾教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，等这些整合运动解散后再行动......会耗费大量时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何况，谁知道现在的状况，会持续到什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，就应该迅速击溃敌人并转移。我说的，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我服从你的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"各小组，听好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这些整合运动，还没有意识到我们的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，果断、迅速地解决掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，调集队伍吧，现在是你证明自己的时候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的局势，可不允许我们有所保留。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"早就该交给我了！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"简单，我会轻松解决的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，看你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......“如果争端能够避免，那我们应当沉默——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——如果战斗是必要的，那就战斗到最后！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的信条......从来没有改变过！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]}]}
